package m10core046roots
    provides [checks, expected_vector, observe, case_body, descriptor, context, check, check_ref, expected_check, evidence, observation, failed, test_case]
    uses [text]

/// M10 CORE-046 "bundled verified build: roots green, report inventory".
/// Source: tests/integration/verified_build_test.go symbol
/// TestCurrentBundledVerifiedBuild (L22-402); passing fixture
/// docs/syntax-taste/evidence/2026-09-22/implementation-gaps/
/// projects/passing/src/main.can (L1-15: package app, roots
/// exact and empty).
/// Disposition: RETAIN (migrate row; the old Go harness stays until the
/// integrator retires it after every linked row, variant, environment and
/// control has accepted evidence).
/// Protects (this file): static green baseline of the passing
/// complete build: exit 0 with empty diagnostics, the can.build
/// report identity (schema 1, entry.ts, 64-char build id), the
/// six bound input digests, the 2/2/0 assertion totals with
/// evidence, the 5000ms verified policy, and the staged entry
/// inventory (package app, roots exact + empty, src/main.can).
/// ADAPTATION (recorded, with source lines): the Go report leg
/// (L120-157) pins totals and identities but no per-function
/// count, so assert-name-a/b record the static assert inventory
/// for P23 qualification (fixture L7 exact, L14 empty); no
/// execution is claimed here (accept_after P23/QHTTP unmet).
/// Facet map (verified_build_test.go passing leg): build-green
/// pins exit 0 with empty diagnostics (L116-119); report-passed
/// pins the 2/2/0 totals with evidence (L149); schema-version
/// pins 1 (L141); report-kind pins can.build (L141); entry-name
/// pins entry.ts (L141); root-count pins 2 (L149); passed-count
/// pins 2 (L149); failed-count pins 0 (L149); timeout-ms pins
/// 5000 (L152); validation pins verified (L152); build-id-len
/// pins 64 (L141); input-digest-count pins the six 64-char
/// source/dependency/catalogue/compiler/runtime/options digests
/// (L126-128, L144-148); assert-name-a pins exact (fixture L7);
/// assert-name-b pins empty (fixture L14, Go L249);
/// fixture-path pins src/main.can (Go L190/L224);
/// fixture-package pins app (fixture L1).
/// Build semantics live in core-046-build-semantics.can; the
/// production run shape lives in core-046-run-shape.can.
/// Variants: none in this file (default only); the wrong-assert,
/// rebuild, selected, timeout, uncovered, sticky, vendor and
/// live variants live in build-semantics.
/// Environment: CAN_BUN_ARCHIVE + macOS sandbox-exec; requires
/// can-bun-archive, macos-sandbox-exec. Logical gates
/// SUITE/BUILD/ENV/DIAG and C/R/N/S/A identities bind at P23;
/// no live run now. Descriptor timeout 360000ms mirrors the Go
/// 6-minute ctx (L29).
/// Delegated oracles: none.
/// Execution credit: NOT claimed (accept_after P23/QHTTP unmet).
/// Case dist/verified-build-roots checks: build-green,
/// report-passed, schema-version, report-kind, entry-name,
/// root-count, passed-count, failed-count, timeout-ms,
/// validation, build-id-len, input-digest-count, assert-name-a,
/// assert-name-b, fixture-path, fixture-package.
/// Shared old files untouched; retirement is a later integrator decision.

